OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly fine, but rather humid
OL,6,Fand on the cloudy side at times,
OL,7,Fespecially in the west, where one or
OL,8,Ftwo light showers are possible.
OL,9,FBrightest in the east throughout, with
OL,10,Fthe best sunny spells here. Becoming
OL,11,Fbreezier later, above-average
OL,12,Ftemperatures.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FBecoming cloudier during the
OL,15,Fevening, with spells of rain
OL,16,Fpunctuated by some heavier bursts
OL,17,Fmoving through later from the west.
OL,18,FBecoming drier, cooler and clearer in
OL,19,Fthe northwest by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
